body: "## Baseline evidence\\n\\nGitHub reports 11 open Dependabot PRs, a critical Vitest advisory, a low esbuild advisory, no open CodeQL findings, and disabled native secret scanning. bun audit on the release head reports 41 advisories: 1 critical, 7 high, 31 moderate, and 2 low. Existing bot PRs split coupled upgrades and fail frozen-lockfile or peer-resolution checks.\\n\\n## Delivery strategy\\n\\nReplace fragmented bot updates with one coherent, lockfile-consistent upgrade; test breaking majors together; modernize CI runtimes/actions; audit source and packaging; preserve all findings as linked issues and future backlog."
